PS1:(env variable)
```````````````````
To set PS1 var (for Current Working Env Only)
PS1="dheeraj> "

username@hostname:~$


\u	The username of the current user.
\h	The hostname (short name).
\w	The current working directory (full path, ~ for home).
\W	The basename of the current working directory (just the folder name).
\t	The current time in 24-hour HH:MM:SS format.
\d	The current date in "Weekday Month Day" format.
\$	Displays $ for a regular user or # for the root user.


PS1='┌─[\d]──[\u@\h:\w]\$ '

